#: ../../api/bindings.md:1 f22d30666f84410b81092e7c39944372
msgid "Generating bindings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/bindings.md:3 2718c8ddcdb641cfbbac9a76d89e8134
msgid ""
"The schema is a repository of its own, [ql-"
"protobuf](https://github.com/markccchiang/ql-protobuf), mounted here as "
"the `proto/` submodule. **No generated code is checked in anywhere** — "
"each consumer runs its own generator, so there is one source of truth and"
" no stale binding sitting beside a schema that moved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/bindings.md:13 392bd54ac17347dba04635426bf21821
msgid "The layout is what you import against:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/bindings.md:24 0a37a6be60e94227bfab88072c309557
msgid ""
"`v2` imports `v1`'s `conventions.proto`, so generate both even though "
"only `v2` is served."
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/bindings.md:27 aff1958f33494d6c84838a0bc5bb7207
msgid "Python"
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/bindings.md:36 d5cb029690ce4495b2710129f6bd3ad5
msgid ""
"The `touch` is not optional: `protoc` writes the package directories "
"without `__init__.py`, and the import fails without them. Put `pb` on "
"`sys.path` and the modules are `quantlib.v2.envelope_pb2` and friends."
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/bindings.md:40 fad8595124a34ceabb246c8c901eca55
msgid ""
"Two names catch people out. `ResultKind` lives in `results_pb2`, not in "
"`envelope_pb2` where the request that carries it lives; and the `Value` "
"variant's oneof is called `v`, so the accessor is "
"`value.WhichOneof(\"v\")`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/bindings.md:44 da56fdc9fd434b32b068fb3c25c12f31
msgid "TypeScript"
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/bindings.md:46 8d6b75e6cf8a40e2950b05dd08ac535c
msgid ""
"The frontend generates with [buf](https://buf.build) and `protoc-gen-es`,"
" which produces plain ES modules with no runtime service dependency:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/bindings.md:66 70431795bfd84c199065a21da988efac
msgid ""
"Encode and decode with the schema objects rather than methods on the "
"message:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/bindings.md:76 a39c66d00b5d42d7a0ea88c8883188a1
msgid ""
"Keep the output directory out of version control and regenerate on "
"install — the frontend gitignores `src/gen` and runs its `gen` script "
"from `prepare`, so a moved schema cannot be shadowed by a checked-in "
"binding."
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/bindings.md:80 6af8198cf44946a899bc45013dc972d4
msgid "C++"
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/bindings.md:82 f648c11084214f7c9964a0efeedfd3b6
msgid ""
"This repository generates its own at build time; `CMakeLists.txt` is the "
"worked example. `protobuf_generate` is given the `.proto` files directly "
"and writes into `<builddir>/generated/`, whose root goes on the include "
"path so a header is included by its package path:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/bindings.md:91 ead74c59be8e4057997066178fad2d62
msgid ""
"Find Protobuf in CONFIG mode (`find_package(Protobuf CONFIG REQUIRED)`) —"
" the deprecated `FindProtobuf` module misses the abseil dependencies "
"libprotobuf now carries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/bindings.md:95 7249772d55514e0ea2cda317c506574d
msgid "Versions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/bindings.md:97 1ca453b92ed1442583192e2b8c307b00
msgid ""
"The schema is clean under `protoc 34.0`. Anything recent enough to know "
"about `optional` in proto3 will do; the schema uses no extensions, no "
"services and no `Any`."
msgstr ""

